UID:170e0075d082bfae196712264b126e9a@madamsorgan.com
DESCRIPTION:A taste of Texas in the nation’s capital\, a bit of Dixie in
  the District\, Human Country Jukebox plays the best classic country and w
 estern songs by the likes of Bob Wills\, Hank Williams\, Willie Nelson\, J
 ohnny Cash\, Waylon Jennings\, and more. If these songs don’t get your h
 ands clapping and your feet stomping you should probably see a doctor. And
  don’t say\, “I don’t like country music.” If you like great singi
 ng\, expert playing\, soulful\, bluesy\, “I’m so sad I could drink\, s
 o happy I could drink some more” music then you’ll enjoy Human Country
  Jukebox. Front man Jack Gregori grew up singing and playing whatever musi
 cal instruments were around him. “I got hooked when I was a kid in the 8
 0’s and…
LOCATION:Madam's Organ Blues Bar\, 2461 18th Street NW\, Washington\, DC 2
 0009
URL:https://madamsorgan.com/events/human-country-jukebox-featuring-jack-gr
 egori-2/
